  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RECLAIM Sustainability! Ivory Coast-Cocoa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to a sustainable and inclusive global cocoa value chain, in which producers received a fair value for their produce and work under safe conditions, without the use of child labour, and land rights and forests are protected.</narrative>
